{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bikehawaii/items/547932/", "pk": 547932, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bikehawaii/", "pk": 196, "shortname": "bikehawaii", "name": "Bike Hawaii", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "E-Bike Tour – Honolulu Rainforest Ride", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 11, "unicode": "E-Bike Tour – Honolulu Rainforest Ride", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 6.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 4.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 2, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 2000, "description": "#“10-Miles of Smiles”.. Yes, E-bike tours are here in Honolulu, Hawaii.\n\n##Times and duration\n- Daily except Sunday\n- Appx. 3 hours\n\n##Restrictions\nRiders must know how to ride a bike, be at least 14-years old, and 5-ft in height and not weigh more than 250lbs.\n\n##Includes\nWe will pick you up in Waikiki in our air-conditioned shuttle and bring you to the foothills to begin the ride.  We supply E-Bikes, helmets and a professional nature guide.\n\n##About\nIntroducing our latest innovation: the solar-powered electric-assist bicycle tour. Featuring an 11-speed drivetrain, 250-watt motor, and 500-watt battery, our e-bikes offer a powerful boost for climbing while maintaining the exhilarating feel of riding a mountain bike. Ascend above Honolulu on our 10MilesofSmiles ride, a paved mountain road adventure perfect for couples.\nClimbing over 1,600 feet above Honolulu, you’ll be treated to breathtaking vistas stretching from Manoa Valley to Diamond Head, and from Waikiki to Ewa Beach and Pearl Harbor, with the majestic Waianae Mountains on the horizon. Along the way, we make stops at the finest viewpoints, allowing you to capture the memories of this lush rainforest journey.\nAs you pedal through changing landscapes of eucalyptus forest, swamp mahogany, bamboo, and banyan, you may find yourself riding through the clouds and mist, serenaded by the songs of various birds. It’s a true nature biking experience, offering a glimpse into the untamed beauty of Oahu’s rainforest.\n\nRiders must know how to ride a bike, be at least 14-years old, and 5-ft in height and not weigh more than 240lbs.\n\nYou can elect to make this a Private Guided tour with just you and your special someone (rates apply). Just check the box for that special offer.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#WHAT'S INCLUDED\n - 250watt Electric-assist Kona Mountain Bike (pedaling is required)\n - Helmet & hip pack\n - Professional nature guides\n - Boxed waters and granola bars\n\n**Note:** Gratuities are not included. Suggested gratuity: 10% of tour price.\n\n#WHAT TO BRING\nPlease wear shoes, bring sunscreen, snacks, water, camera, etc.", "cancellation_notes": "When booking this activity through a 3rd party, their cancellation policy applies. When booking direct, our cancellation policy is 24 hours before the tour. 50% within 24 hours and full charge for No Show.", "no_transportation_notes": "Please meet us at [Archie Baker Park](https://maps.app.goo.gl/hgz8eYy7kdvVcnqj7)", "no_transportation_minutes": 0, "headline": "Ages 14+ • Appx. 3 hour tour", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri":